1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,635
The lottery's own security director rigged the damn thing in five states.

2
00:00:04,485 --> 00:00:07,731
Wait, it's worse: he told a court he wrote code to predict numbers.

3
00:00:07,981 --> 00:00:10,057
Send this to whoever plays every week.

4
00:00:10,357 --> 00:00:14,582
Biggest ticket, sixteen point five million advertised? Follow, guess what it paid.

5
00:00:14,932 --> 00:00:20,861
Not a fucking cent. He got up to twenty-five years. You still trust the damn lottery?
